window.products.push({"id":646042,"name":"Olicity Cheesecloth, Grade 90, 45 Square Feet, 100% Unbleached Cheese Cloth Cotton Fabric Ultra Fine Muslin Cloths Reusable Cheese Cloths for Strainin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UJBm4TuSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Unbleached Cotton - Olicity cheesecloth is made from 100% natural pure cotton, never been dyed or bleached. There is no color will dye over the cheese, yogurt, turkey or any other foods. Grade 90 Cheesecloth with Upgraded Hemmed 2 Edges - Grade 90 is the highest grade and best quality in cheesecloth. Comparing to the traditional cheesecloth, the design of hemmed 2 edges can avoid the small threads falling into foods as few as possible. It has 44x36 threads/inch, more impurities will be filtered out. It is perfect for household cooking and chef's ingredients preparation because of its durability. Lint Free & Reusable - Only pure cotton can be used in our Grade 90 Cheesecloth, we always refuse and never get recycled fibers or other impurities in the cloth. Therefore our cheesecloth is lint free and no easy to get loose. And it also can be reusable many times over, just need to clean it with a mild detergent and warm water. Household Multiple Uses - Our cheesecloth is a very versatile tool in the home! It is very useful when you are making soft cheeses or yoghurt, basting or stuffing poultry, roasting turkey or chicken, keeping chicken or fish intact when poaching, wrapping spices, straining stocks, squeezing juice without seeds, wine making, crafting, wrapping, cleaning etc. A Must Preparation for Halloween - Olicity cheesecloth is perfect for Halloween decorations because it's free transform and free cutting. You can prepare it for making ghosts, spider webs, scary customizing, wrap pumpkins into mummies and any other scary but interesting things.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UJBm4TuSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Olicity","source_asin":"B094HXL6HN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-646042","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094HXL6HN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094HXL6HN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":646043,"name":"Crane USA Convection Heater, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZMok+cbFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Warm up your space in style with the Crane Convection Heater. Featuring an ultra-slim design and a built-in fan for quick and efficient heat circulation when you need it, the Crane Convection Heater is the ideal addition to any room where you need extra warmth. You will appreciate the ease of using the thermostat to automatically regulate temperature and the 24-hour timer that allows you to program the heater to turn on and off at your convenience. Convection Heat offers distinct advantages over other types of heating such as Radiant Heat. A liquid is transferred within the unit causing energy to be produced as heat, dispersing naturally throughout the area. This type of heat is also regulated by a thermostat, turning on and off as needed to maintain the desired temperature and maximizing energy efficiency. Most importantly, convection heat is safer than other forms of heating because only the outside surface gets warm. The heating elements are not exposed, meaning the heater itself will never get hot enough to burn you and will never come in contact with flammable objects around it. Convection Heaters are also environmentally safe since they do not use oil to create heat. A sleek design and stylish finishes make this space heater stand out from the rest. Available in a variety of colors to suit your Home’s Décor, Crane’s whisper quiet Convection Heaters are sure to grab the attention of your guests. Crane Convection Heaters also include Overheat Protection that will shut the unit off automatically should the coils inside the unit get too hot. Amazon.com Featuring an ultra slim design, the Crane Convection Space Heater is the ideal addition to any room where you need extra warmth. With two different heat settings, the space heater provides a money-saving alternative to heating your entire house. This unit features an optional built-in fan for quick and efficient heat circulation, a thermostat to automatically regulate temperature, and a timer that lets you program the heater to turn on and off at your convenience. Convection Space Heater(Black) At a Glance: Portable convection heater with two settings for large and small rooms Portable convection heater with two settings for large and small rooms Allergy friendly, does not stir up dust particles Allergy friendly, does not stir up dust particles Does not dry out room air Does not dry out room air Overheat protection, shuts off automatically Overheat protection, shuts off automatically Built-in optional fan provides quick and efficient heat circulation Built-in optional fan provides quick and efficient heat circulation 24-hour programmable timer 24-hour programmable timer Limited one-year warranty Limited one-year warranty Assembly Requirements: Attach feet to heater using tapping screws (included) This heater features a convection heat circulation, providing an energy-efficient heat source for winter heating without drying out the air. View larger . Its dual output options and timer allow you to easily warm up small or large rooms when needed, while its automatic shutoff helps eliminate fire hazards. View larger . Allergy Friendly and Prevents Dry Air The Crane Convection Heater does not stir up dust particles which could cause allergic reactions. Due to its gentle convection heat circulation, the room air does not dry out as quickly as with forced air heaters, providing an energy-efficient heat source for winter heating. Dual Heat Settings and Adjustable Thermostat With its adjustable heat settings, the Crane Convection Space Heater is ideal for warming both smaller and larger rooms. The heater features a maximum output of 1,500 watts for larger spaces and a lower 750-watt setting for smaller rooms. The heater also features an adjustable thermostat, which lets you set your desired temperature. When the desired room temperature has been reached, the heater will keep the air temperature in the room at the set level by switching on and off automatically, so you use only as much electricity as you need. 24-Hour Programmable Timer For convenience and safety, you can set the space heater's programmable timer to turn the heater on and off at specific times during the day. Preheat your child's room before bedtime, or warm up your kitchen before your morning coffee. Automatic Shutoff Ensures Safe Operation Safety features include an automatic shutoff to avoid overheating, an indicator light to let you know the heater's on, and a polarized plug to reduce the risk of electrical shock. Together, these safety measures help eliminate fire hazards and give you peace of mind. The Crane Convection Space Heater is backed by a manufacturer's limited one-year warranty. What's in the Box Crane Convection Space Heater (Black) with two feet, four screws, and user manual. With its slim design and fashionable color options in black, red, and white, the Crane space heatercan easily be matched to most room decors for discrete style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZMok+cbFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crane","source_asin":"B00BGE89WU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-646043","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BGE89WU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BGE89WU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
