window.products.push({"id":646114,"name":"Water Pitcher, 3.17 Quart, Water Pitcher with Lid and Spout, BPA-FREE Plastic Pitcher, Jarras Para Aguas Frescas, Iced Tea Pitcher, 0.84 Gallon Pitche","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zcqriBEYL._AC_.jpg","description":"Introducing the ultimate solution for your serving needs, the plastic pitcher is designed to cater to all your drink-serving requirements, with its sleek design and durable material. With this pitcher in hand, you can serve your drinks with ease and style. Made from high-quality plastic, our pitcher is built to last. The plastic used in our pitcher is BPA-free. The pitcher is shatter-resistant and can withstand high temperatures, making it suitable for both hot and cold beverages. You can use it to serve your favorite drinks at your next party or event, without worrying about any accidental spills or breakages. One of the key features of our Plastic Pitcher is its lightweight and easy-to-handle design. Its ergonomic handle ensures a comfortable grip, even when the pitcher is full. The spout is designed to pour drinks smoothly and prevent drips and spills. The wide opening makes it easy to add ice, fruits, or other flavorings, giving you endless possibilities to create your favorite drinks. Our Plastic Pitcher is not just a convenient and practical solution for serving drinks, but it's also an elegant and stylish addition to any table setting. Its clear design allows you to showcase the colors and textures of your drinks, while its minimalist style complements any decor. Whether you're hosting a casual brunch or an elegant dinner party, our pitcher is the perfect way to serve your drinks in style. Cleaning our Plastic Pitcher is a breeze, its smooth surface prevents any residue from sticking. You can also clean it by hand with a soft sponge, ensuring that it remains in perfect condition for years to come. Our Plastic Pitcher is versatile and perfect for any occasion. Use it to serve water, iced tea, lemonade, or any other beverage of your choice. It's perfect for outdoor events, picnics, barbecues, or even for everyday use in your home. Its durability and practicality make it an excellent choice for families with children or anyone who loves to entertain. In summary, the Plastic Pitcher is the ultimate solution for all your drink-serving needs. Its high-quality, plastic material, lightweight design, and elegant style make it the perfect addition to any table setting. With its durability and versatility, it's a product that will serve you for years to come. Order yours today and experience the convenience, practicality, and style of our Plastic Pitcher!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zcqriBEYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smarthome","source_asin":"B08GZNLKVD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-646114","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GZNLKVD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GZNLKVD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
