window.products.push({"id":646163,"name":"TEMOLA Meat Thermometer, Instant Read Food Thermometer with LCD Backlight Calibration, Waterproof Ultra Fast Digital Cooking Thermometer for Candy Dee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CgOTnxp6L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ultra Fast & Accurate - Instant read meat thermometer features 4.6\" food grade stainless steel probe with a precise sensor provides 2-3S response time, with an accuracy of 1°C and a wide temp range of -58°F - 572°F (-50°C- 300°C); Cooking food thermometer can be effective enough to determine whether food is well cooked. The kitchen cooking thermometer is perfect for meat, food, candy, milk, water, oil, baking, grill, bbq, smoker. IP67 Waterproof & Durability - The food thermometer is made of high-quality waterproof eco-friendly ABS plastic, which means it’s easy to wash the cooking thermometer under running water. With IP67 certification, the grill thermometer is super easy to clean. (NOTE: Please wipe it with a soapy cloth or rinse it to clean, and DO NOT soak it or put it in a dishwasher) Durable ABS plastic body, can withstand accidental drops or other impact accidents. Calibration & Temperature Records - Each TM26 cooking thermometer is pre-calibrated individually in the factory by high-precision temperature standards. However, if you feel unconfident about the accuracy, you can check it or calibrate the temperature yourself with a cup of ice water which is properly prepared. The grill BBQ thermometer also has a special function that records the maximum and minimum temperature during the whole process. Power Saving & Easy to Use - The kitchen thermometer contains a CR2032 battery and comes with an extra one. More than 10000+hours battery life allows you to enjoy the cooking thermometer for a whole year. The candy thermometer has a large LCD with Bright backlight which helps to read easily in day and night. Abundant Components and Accessories - TM26 meat thermometer comes together with 2 batteries, 1 drawstring bag, 1 well-designed meat temperature guide, 1 detailed instruction, 4 hook/loops to hang your temperature guide on the wall. These all together make it a great value for your wise choice. TM26 food thermometer is also well packaged for friends, family, favorites. Contact us if you have any issue or advice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CgOTnxp6L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TEMOLA","source_asin":"B0BZDKN64Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-646163","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZDKN64Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZDKN64Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
