window.products.push({"id":646337,"name":"Brielle Home 100-Percent Modal from Beech Jersey Knitted Sheet Set, Standard, Fleur Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zjZKQDk9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brielle Modal Jerseys are the softest sheets in the market. Give it a try, you won't be disappointed. What is Brielle? Brielle is our exclusive home textiles brand. In Brielle we distilled 60 years of expertise to deliver the best value in home textiles. We carry an extensive selection of bedding products with cotton, modal, tencel/lyocell, bamboo fibers in sateen jersey, twill and percale weaves. The selection of fabric, size and color options often are not offered by local stores and delivered to your door at your convenience. We also carry a wide selection of window panels. Whether you are shopping for a sheet set, window panels or bathrobe, Brielle will deliver the best product for your money. Luxury bedding and home textiles for factory prices. Guaranteed. What is Modal? This bedding product is made of Modal which is a high strength fiber, famous for its silky softness. Modal has a refined smooth touch, excellent breathability and moisture management features. We used the Lensing Modal, Austrian produced Modal fiber, made of the natural cellulose from Beech wood trees of Europe. Lensing Modal is manufactured with high sustainability and ecological standards. Austrians are known for their fancy high tech sport cars and idyllic mountain scenes. They did not fall short in the glamour department with this marvelous fiber. What is jersey? Jersey is the weave type of the fabric. This jersey bedding is knitted, like a fine T-shirt to provide a silky soft, feathery light touch to your skin, ensuring a good night's sleep. Coupled with Modal fabric's natural softness and sheen, you will not want to get out of bed. Jersey is the softest weave available for bedding. If you prefer a heavy duty fabric please search for Brielle Sateen or Brielle Twill collections.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zjZKQDk9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brielle Home","source_asin":"B00KNW7IYG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-646337","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KNW7IYG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KNW7IYG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
