window.products.push({"id":646407,"name":"Mini Bag Sealer – Portable Sealing Machine with Detachable Hook – Heat Vacuum Sealers Plastic Sealer – 2 in 1 (Heat Seal & Cutter) – Mini Food Sealer ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415i0h40fqL._AC_.jpg","description":"The mini bag sealer is made from ABS material, which can resistant to high and low temperatures that make it live longer. This Mini Bag Sealer is durable, healthy and Eco-friendly, it can be used for a long time without damage. The mini sealer can be used at home to store food properly, and to save space and plastic bags. This is not just a sealing machine, but also an opening machine. One end of the heat sealer can seal the bag, the whole process will not exceed 10 seconds; the other end can cut the bag, and it can be cut in just 1 second. The Mini bag sealer machine can seal multiple common packaging bags with thickness that is 0.3mm or less, such as storage bags, chips bags, snack bags, PP, PE, PVC bags etc. Not suitable for pure paper bags & pure aluminum bags. You can also seal the fresh-keeping bag to prevent the taste of food from changing. Seal all your foods for airtight food storage with our mini bag sealer. With this chip re-sealer, you can re-use the original bag, keep foods and snacks fresher, and reduce food waste. You can seal your snacks, cereal bags, meats, leftovers and so on to keep it from becoming stale. No need to worry about containers leaking or opening which lead a mess or food spoilage. This portable plastic sealer is compact size and easy to carry, can be easily store into your bag or pocket and you can hand it in your kitchen or refrigerator. Whether you go camping, picnic or the kitchen and living room, it's a good helper to cut and seal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415i0h40fqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gotical","source_asin":"B08S92GVMZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-646407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S92GVMZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S92GVMZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
