window.products.push({"id":646490,"name":"SUNNYPARK Christmas Tree Stand for Live Tree, Adjustable Metal Tree Holder for Real Christmas Tree fits up to 8.5 Ft, Metal Christmas Tree Stand Base ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AfhNdTUFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Outstanding Christmas Tree Stands】Every part of getting and decorating a Christmas tree should be fun, even putting it in its stand. The stand is constructed of metal for durability and years of use and has a spike inside base to offer extra security. It provides you with a sturdy support to keep your tree upright at all times and brings a touch of glamour to your Christmas décor. 【Suitable Size】Capable of supporting trees up to approximately 8.5 feet tall with strong eye screws that can be adjusted to accommodate trunks of a variety of sizes. 5.3 inch tall cylinder base is enough higher to holds a tree up, and it helps to keep your tree fresher for longer as a watertight base holder. Breaks the xmas tree stand down for easy storage throughout the rest of the year. 【Installation】Inserted a freshly cut Christmas tree into this Christmas tree stand cylinder. Make sure the tree is properly centered and as close to plumb as possible, then tighten 3 massive brass-plated eye screws. Each flange nut on the end of each screw provides firm, well-distributed pressure and prevents the screw from digging into the tree’s bark. 【Material & Structure】This Christmas Tree Stand fits snugly around your tree. It made from durable material with waterproof coating. 3 rhombic-shaped structure legs made from a robust, durable iron to create a stable and secure base for real trees. The weight of your tree is easily distributed over these 3 legs, minimising any chance of toppling or slanting. 【Get Metal Christmas Tree Stand Now!】Tired of your Christmas tree falling over and breaking your priceless family Christmas Tree Ornaments? Don't settle for a weak undersized plastic Christmas Tree Stand for a live Christmas tree. Choose the real Christmas tree stand from red, black, green or gold finishes to match your other decorations. It will make post-holiday cleanup quick and painless.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AfhNdTUFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUNNYPARK","source_asin":"B096XJCQCW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-646490","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096XJCQCW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096XJCQCW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
