window.products.push({"id":646495,"name":"LEEEBS Mandoline Vegetable Slicer(TM)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AYfXydV2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why spend all the time preparing for your meal slicing and cutting by hand? With the amazing Mandoline Slicer Set, you will be able to prep for any meal in half the time. With 4 inserts, you will save time cutting, grating, and peeling. Each set includes a bottom container to catch your peels and slices which means hands free prep work. The bottom catch container also doubles as a storage container for storing sliced vegetables or fruit. With the handy hand guard, you can keep your hands and fingers safe from the sharp blades as you work. Everything stores together neatly which cuts down on kitchen clutter. Super easy to set up, use and clean up is a breeze. The Mandoline Slicer Set is your all in one solution for saving time with your prep work needs in the kitchen! Every kitchen needs certain gadgets in order to function better, but there comes a time when the gadgets can over take every space on your counter, in your cabinets or in every drawer. By combing gadgets into one compact kitchen tool, you are maximizing the space in your kitchen and minimizing your prep time. With this beautiful Mandoline Vegetable Slicer by Leeebs, you will slice, zest, grate and julienne to your hearts content. The best part is the wonderful container that catches each piece of fruit or vegetable that you slice, for easy storage or to just catch the ingredients to pour into your culinary creation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AYfXydV2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEEEBS","source_asin":"B014E3XFYG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-646495","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014E3XFYG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014E3XFYG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
