window.products.push({"id":646620,"name":"Prepara Oil Mister, Glass Base, 4.5 oz, Deluxe White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oPhTnMBYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Deluxe Oil Mister by Prepara, the healthy lifestyle brand, has been improved and is better than ever! Prepara tools are designed to enhance your cooking experience and simplify preparation with elegant designs and kitchen-tested performance. The Deluxe Oil Mister by Prepara is a healthy and economical alternative to aerosol spray can oils. It is made from BPA free materials with a sterilizable glass reservoir. To use, simply fill the glass base with your choice of oil: Vegetable oil, olive oil, canola oil, grape seed oil and more. Use the cap to perfectly pump air into the mister (about 7-12 pumps) and press the nozzle to spray a fine, even mist. It's simple: no harmful CFC's are needed to spray- Just air! Perfect for cookie and muffin pans, preparing eggs or pancakes, grilling meat or dressing a salad. The Deluxe Oil Mister creates a thin coating of oil: ideal for low-fat, high-flavor cooking. The patented filtering system ensures the spraying mechanism will not clog and the entire mister is top-rack dishwasher safe. Prepara is committed to making sure all products work perfectly and this item is at its best. The deluxe oil mister is backed by a five-year warranty. For the first use after filling with oil, please pump the unit several times and press the spray nozzle- then repeat. Repeat the process 3 times to ensure that the pump mechanism is fully filled with oil to properly spray. During use, ensure that the lid and base are completely screwed tight. If they are not screwed together tightly, a seal cannot form, which hinders spraying.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oPhTnMBYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prepara","source_asin":"B0053PZIWW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-646620","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0053PZIWW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0053PZIWW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
