window.products.push({"id":646655,"name":"VWMYQ Christmas Tree Hanging Pendant Crafts Elves Decorations Gnome Christmas Ornaments Set of 4 PCS Handmade Swedish Tomte Gnomes Plush Scandinavian ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lZ8ZuEPIL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"🎄 Christmas Gnomes Ornaments Set - Gnome, the best Christmas Ornament in 2020. Also known as a Tomte or Nisse. In folklore, Gnome guards the home and protect people from misfortune. The elf gnome will bring us good luck, happiness, warmth and also add a little magical to our home. 🎄 Material: Plush 🎄 Size: 2.95 * 5.9 In 🎄 Features: During Christmas, Decorate Your Door Or Wall With A Nice Decoration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lZ8ZuEPIL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VWMYQ","source_asin":"B08KWCJ7V1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-646655","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KWCJ7V1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KWCJ7V1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":646656,"name":"Art of Place Lake Cumberland Kentucky Map Metal Print on Reclaimed Barn Wood from Illustration by Lakebound 11.5\" x 17.5\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719dKDsMRmL._AC_SL1333_.jpg","description":"This work of art is by the artists at Lakebound. Many people have strong and lasting memories of fun holidays and vacations at the lake or on the coast. Summers learning to water ski, swim, sleep-away camp, cliff jumping, time at the cabin, the smell of shady coves and bays, the lazy days melting into warm evenings, and fall after the crowds leave. There is something about the being on the water that is like nowhere else. Lakebound classic vintage maps are geographically accurate and bring a little lake or coastal magic to you and the walls of your home or office. This Metal art print mounted on reclaimed American barn wood is from an original work of art created by an award-winning artist. Each artist has a unique style and vision that uniquely captures the personality and life of the place. All metal prints are professionally printed and mounted in USA. We use the highest quality heavy-gauge steel and genuine reclaimed, solid American barn wood for your artwork. The art is printed with premium, long-lasting, fade-fade-resistent art inks that generate intense, rich colors that are true to the artist’s vision and original creation. The time and care put into producing your metal on wood art print will make it a tremendous addition to your kitchen, bedroom, family room, office, or even dorm room wall décor. We are committed to providing preeminent and distinctive American and Canadian wall art decor. Discover exclusive, American-made and designed wall art of beautiful and popular destinations throughout the world from Art of Place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719dKDsMRmL._AC_SL1333_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Art of Place","source_asin":"B07Q7MLMS5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-646656","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q7MLMS5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q7MLMS5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
