window.products.push({"id":646819,"name":"EurKitchen Premium Ice Cream Maker Machine For Home - 2 Quart Ice Cream Machine (or Frozen Yogurt) - Sleek, 18W, Built to Last, Easy-to-Use & Electric","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VpcauFgqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Indulgent Ice Cream in Minutes - Have your fill of ice cream in the comfort of your home with EurKitchen Homemade Ice Cream Maker. No need to get dressed and go on a scavenger hunt for the flavor you crave. Feeling indulgent? Throw in more chocolate, marshmallows, almonds, and cookies! Want something healthy? Toss in some sliced bananas and strawberries. Experiment with ingredients, create unique flavors and enjoy a whole quart of goodness to relish. High-Quality Gift for Dessert Lovers- The EurKitchen Electric Ice Cream Maker Machine for home is engineered to create high-quality ice cream. With the electric motor in the base, this icecream maker produces smoother and creamier ice cream or yogurt. Enjoy brand-name-quality cold desserts you can make for yourself, the family, and guests! Need a present for someone who loves to entertain? We'd list this as one of the best housewarming gifts or new home gift ideas, and fun kitchen gadgets. Silent and Eco-Friendly - With only 18 watts of power consumption, our Ice Cream Maker is perfect for those late-night cravings. How does whipping up your own fresh creamy dessert sound without waking up the kids? At less than 30 decibels, using EurLKitchen icecream machine is whisper quiet, unlike other ice cream machines. Use real fruits for that guilt-free satisfaction. Whether early morning, mid-afternoon, or whatever time of day you feel like indulging. Durable, Easy-to-Clean, and Stylish - The EurKitchen Ice Cream Machine is a lovely, reliable, and long-lasting addition to any kitchen. Made to last and low maintenance, this sleek machine is easy to assemble, or disassemble. It comes with a warranty so you can keep enjoying quarts of rich ice cream or soft frozen yogurt for years. Insulated freezer bowl and recipes included. Elevating Kitchen Creations - We at EurKitchen pride ourselves in creating high-quality, specialty cooking tools that provide an elevated cooking experience. Our goal is to ignite our customers' passion for creating wonderful recipes at home, making them feel confident and proud of their culinary journey. We also aim to help them achieve healthier lifestyles and craft wonderful memories in the kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VpcauFgqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EurKitchen","source_asin":"B09FFMRNW3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-646819","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FFMRNW3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FFMRNW3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
