window.products.push({"id":646903,"name":"XJET Large Acacia Set of 2 Heart Shaped Wooden Spoons for Cooking and Serving - Eco-Friendly Love Spoons - Bridal Shower Gift for Her Great Wedding Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XHYqLitdS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The XJET set of 2 Large wooden spoons are beautifully-made dining essentials offering an all-natural and safe alternative to traditional plastic tableware with each heart-shaped and unique in its rustic appearance. Tropical & Full of Love Go crazy with these beautiful little wooden spoons to enjoy meals inspired by nature. Perfect for cold or hot food, our set of wooden spoons will add that finishing touch to your creations, while an ideal addition to other wood bowls and spoons sets. Safe, Sustainable, Eco-Friendly These stylish farmhouse wooden spoons are handmade from untreated acacia wood reclaimed after discarded as waste. Sustainably sourced with no synthetic lacquers, coatings, or glues, our vegan spoons will be ready to compost after long-serving years. With care in every detail, we use 100% biodegradable packaging only. Polished for Perfect Shape Each of the wood kitchen spoons is individually handmade without mold or powered tools and ergonomically designed to comfortably fit in hands. The edges of these cooking spoons are smooth, finely polished, and safe for serving. Advantages: With each purchase empowering Wood Carvers of Vietnam artisans, our set comes with many benefits. Non-toxic, tasteless, and odorless Non-toxic, tasteless, and odorless Resistant to cold or warm temperatures Resistant to cold or warm temperatures Don't crack, peel, crumble, dry out, or rot. Don't crack, peel, crumble, dry out, or rot. Dishwasher safe Dishwasher safe Kitchen Gift Idea Neatly packed in a gift-ready kraft box, this love-sharing set makes an entirely sustainable and vegan gift for cooks. Unique in their appearance and details, focusing on bringing out each piece's beauty while preserving their characteristics, no two are ever the same and guaranteed to impress everyone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XHYqLitdS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"xjet","source_asin":"B091V6122F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-646903","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091V6122F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091V6122F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
